   Added concrete Lakebase regressions for unavailable tables, query failures, genuine empty results, and tolerant default behavior.
5. tests/units/registry/test_registry.py
   Verified cleanup requests strict listing, propagates failures, and treats a genuine empty corpus as successful.
6. .superpowers/sdd/final-fix-report.md
   Recorded the strict-listing contract, RED/GREEN evidence, caller impact, verification, and remaining cross-store limitation.

